{
  "slug": "seo-intelligence",
  "name": "Seo Intelligence",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "AI-powered SEO analysis, competitor comparison, and ranking plans. Analyze any page's SEO health, compare against top-ranking competitors, and get prioritized action plans to rank higher.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **11 skills**, **3 agents**, **8 commands** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (11): `aeo-visibility` (Checks AI search engine citation visibility), `competitor-analysis` (Runs competitor gap analysis against top-ranking pages), `content-strategy` (Generates data-driven SEO content briefs from competitor analysis), `ecommerce-seo` (Audits e-commerce product page SEO and validates Product schema), `international-seo` (Validates hreflang tags and international SEO configuration), `keyword-research` (Clusters keywords by SERP overlap and classifies search intent), `local-seo` (Checks local SEO and Google 3-Pack visibility for local businesses), `on-page-seo` (Analyzes on-page SEO health for any URL), and 3 more\n- **Agents** (3): `competitor-analyzer` (Autonomous competitor research agent), `content-strategist` (Autonomous content strategy agent), `seo-auditor` (Autonomous SEO audit agent)\n- **Commands** (8): `competitor-gap` (Competitor gap analysis against top-ranking pages for a keyword), `content-brief` (Generate an SEO content brief from competitor analysis), `generate-schema` (Generate production-ready JSON-LD schema markup for any page), `keyword-cluster` (Cluster keywords by SERP overlap and detect cannibalization), `ranking-plan` (Prioritized action plan to rank higher for a target keyword), `seo-audit` (Comprehensive multi-keyword SEO audit with competitor analysis and overall site score), `seo-check` (Quick on-page SEO health check), `technical-audit` (Full technical SEO infrastructure audit)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `seo-intelligence`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install seo-intelligence@claude-community` from `trentiums/seo-intelligence`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
